// Title: Uninstall Sysinternals Sysmon
// ID: 6a5f68d1-c4b5-46b9-94ee-5324892ea939
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-01-12
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects the removal of Sysmon, which could be a potential attempt at defense evasion
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "-u") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/u"))) AND (((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\Sysmon64.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\Sysmon64a.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\Sysmon.exe"))) OR (where(Description = "System activity monitor"))))
